sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Envoy as Envoy / Agent Gateway<br/>Sidecar Proxy
    participant EPP as EPP<br/>(Endpoint Picker Plugin)
    participant Decode as decode Pod<br/>(vLLM API Server)<br/>8000/TCP HTTP
    participant MXServer as ModelExpress Server<br/>8001/TCP gRPC
    participant DecodeB as decode Worker B<br/>5555/TCP, 6555/TCP gRPC
    participant HF as HuggingFace Hub<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant OTel as OpenTelemetry Collector<br/>4317/TCP gRPC

    Note over Client,OTel: Flow 1: Inference Request

    Client->>Envoy: POST /v1/completions<br/>HTTP, Platform-dependent auth
    Envoy->>EPP: Select backend pod<br/>InferencePool routing
    EPP-->>Envoy: Target pod endpoint
    Envoy->>Decode: Forward request<br/>HTTP 8000/TCP, No encryption, No auth
    Decode-->>Envoy: Inference response (JSON)
    Envoy-->>Client: Response

    Note over Client,OTel: Flow 2: P2P KV Cache Transfer (ModelExpress)

    Decode->>MXServer: Register / query KV cache metadata<br/>gRPC 8001/TCP, Istio mTLS STRICT<br/>AuthorizationPolicy (SA-scoped)
    MXServer-->>Decode: Cache location metadata
    Decode->>DecodeB: Metadata advertisement<br/>gRPC 5555/TCP, No encryption (RDMA bypass)
    Decode->>DecodeB: Tensor transfer<br/>gRPC 6555/TCP, No encryption (RDMA bypass)
    DecodeB-->>Decode: Transfer acknowledgment

    Note over Client,OTel: Model Loading (startup)

    Decode->>HF: Download model artifacts<br/>HTTPS 443/TCP, TLS, HF_TOKEN

    Note over Client,OTel: Observability

    Decode->>OTel: Export traces<br/>gRPC OTLP 4317/TCP
